WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.140
A short news report, in official style.

2
00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:07.630
Zamknięcie drogi spowodowało korki.

3
00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:14.020
An action becomes a noun: the closure caused the jams.

4
00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:16.590
Palenie szkodzi zdrowiu.

5
00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:20.640
