7
00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:28.440
Dziękuję za zaproszenie.

8
00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:33.040
Official language turns verbs into nouns.

9
00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:38.310
In everyday speech, a verb usually sounds more natural.

10
